sin x = x - x**3/6 + x**5/120 - x**7/5040 + O(x**8)
e^x   = 1 + x + x**2/2 + x**3/6 + x**4/24 + O(x**5)
ln(1+x) = x - x**2/2 + x**3/3 - x**4/4 + O(x**5)
1/(1-x) = 1 + x + x**2 + x**3 + x**4 + O(x**5)
P5(x) = x**5/120 - x**3/6 + x
